    "global_organization_chain": [
      "the summary opens on a named upset and only then names the factor",
      "each model arrives with the step that produced it",
      "the randomness doubt is answered with two correlations, one per player",
      "the forecast is turned into advice in the same breath",
      "the epigraph doubts the word the paper will quantify",
      "the set narrative is given before the difficulty",
      "the difficulty is handed to the coach",
      "each assumption grants a factor and then drops it",
      "the ordinary network is praised as a chain and then called broken",
      "the rates are read aloud before they are extended",
      "the streak is granted as a feeling that still cannot be written down",
      "each event is justified by what it does to confidence",
      "the fixed numbers are spoken with the word meaning",
      "a factor that cannot be scored is replaced by a proxy",
      "the count of features is what forces the reduction",
      "the correlation is what decides the kind of model",
      "the lead changes are checked against the match already told",
      "the orders are spoken in words and then written as symbols",
      "every piece of advice has the opponent's case beside it",
      "the second match repeats the narration and limits the generality",
      "the principle is kept and the indicators are retired",
      "the perturbation has a size even though the reading is one word",
      "the memo counts its parts and warns against the risk it recommends"
    ],
